1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,826
This is Cohort Pulse, a Fabric App in preview that

2
00:00:06,826 --> 00:00:10,960
shows a facilitator how well the room is following, live.

3
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:14,566
Each light is one current answer, and the

4
00:00:14,566 --> 00:00:17,260
bands read lost, unsure and got it.

5
00:00:18,385 --> 00:00:21,614
Together the bands make one bar of the room, so lost

6
00:00:21,614 --> 00:00:24,905
can be read against the pause line at thirty percent.

7
00:00:25,355 --> 00:00:28,143
The pulse line beats faster as more of the room is

8
00:00:28,143 --> 00:00:31,155
lost, and nothing on this screen says who tapped what.

9
00:00:31,961 --> 00:00:35,263
Lenses redraw the same totals: every module side by

10
00:00:35,263 --> 00:00:38,241
side, then the trend across the whole session.

11
00:00:42,271 --> 00:00:45,292
Today ranks what needs me now, and picking

12
00:00:45,292 --> 00:00:47,521
an item focuses the room on it.

13
00:00:47,971 --> 00:00:51,131
Three people are active but have not answered this module yet.

14
00:00:51,935 --> 00:00:56,445
Participants check in with a six-character code and get three big buttons.

15
00:00:56,895 --> 00:01:01,035
Sam taps Lost and asks for a worked example in a short note.

16
00:01:02,558 --> 00:01:05,946
Back on the pulse, three of ten are lost, so the

17
00:01:05,946 --> 00:01:09,758
room's light warms and a calm prompt suggests a pause.

18
00:01:10,208 --> 00:01:12,228
The note arrives without a name.

19
00:01:13,034 --> 00:01:16,163
When I share my screen, viewing as Room hides

20
00:01:16,163 --> 00:01:19,084
the notes and shows the join code instead.

21
00:01:20,224 --> 00:01:23,229
Moving on starts the next module fresh, and

22
00:01:23,229 --> 00:01:26,304
every screen catches up within five seconds.

23
00:01:27,104 --> 00:01:30,226
After closing, the session report ranks modules by

24
00:01:30,226 --> 00:01:33,224
confusion; yesterday, Memory lost half the room.

25
00:01:33,674 --> 00:01:38,034
Copy as Markdown drops the whole report into a follow-up email.

26
00:01:38,837 --> 00:01:41,354
Cohort Pulse: know when the room is

27
00:01:41,354 --> 00:01:43,727
lost before anyone has to say so.
